@conversation day2 chapter="Day 2" title="The Café" checkpoint
@scene VN day=2 time=09:15 bg=bg_restaurant.png music=sunny.mp3

narration
  en: Day 2, 9:15 AM. The café from the photo. Nora insisted on coming along.

nora [left]
  en: So this is the place? It looks exactly like the picture.
nora:smile [if PLAN == 'knows_cafe']
  en: Good thing you knew the way. I'd still be wandering down 5th street.
narration [if heard_story == true]
  en: Miki's voice from last night is still in your head. {i}We met at that café in 2019.{/i}

set greeting = random(1, 2)
luna [right] voice=vo_luna_01.mp3 [if greeting == 1]
  en: You must be the one Miki wrote about.
luna [right] voice=vo_luna_01.mp3 [if greeting == 2]
  en: You're the one Miki kept writing about, aren't you?

stage
  flash color=#E6E0FF duration=600
  show miki:frown far_right transition=dissolve duration=900
miki:frown
  en: {color=#B9A8FF}(She can't see me.{w=500} Please...{w} {wave}tell her.{/wave}){/color}
nora:frown
  en: {{NAME}}? Hello? Are you even list-{nw}
nora:frown
  en: ...{w=300}{b}Who{/b} are you staring at?
choice TOLD by=luna
  en: What do you tell Luna?
? Miki is sorry. She wanted you to know.
  value apology
  +miki_trust 10
  +luna_affection 10
? Nothing. It's not my place.
  value silent
  -miki_trust 5
? [Show Luna's photo] She kept this. [if has_cafe_photo == true]
  value photo
  +miki_trust 10
  +luna_affection 15

luna:frown [if TOLD == 'silent']
  en: ...I see. Excuse me.

luna:frown [if TOLD != 'silent']
  en: Anyone could say that. Show me something only Miki had.
evidence PROOF by=luna retries=1 label=ask_proof [if TOLD != 'silent']
  en: Present a clue from your Case Board
? unsent_note
  +luna_affection 5
? luna_photo
  +luna_affection 5
? [retry]
  -> #proof_retry
? [fallback]

luna:smile [if PROOF == 'unsent_note']
  en: That's her handwriting... she never sent it.
luna:smile [if PROOF == 'luna_photo']
  en: That was in her desk drawer. Nobody else had that photo.
luna:frown [if TOLD != 'silent' && PROOF != 'unsent_note' && PROOF != 'luna_photo']
  en: That's not much to go on... still, it sounds like her.

media CG cg_luna_cafe.png unlock=cg_luna_cafe [if TOLD != 'silent']
  en: For the first time in months, Luna smiles.
luna:smile [if TOLD != 'silent']
  en: We had a code for our diary. If you really talked to her, you'll know it.
input PASSCODE default=???? by=luna [if TOLD != 'silent']
  en: Luna slides a napkin over: "Our year." (Did Miki mention one?)

luna:smile [if PASSCODE == '2019']
  en: ...2019. Then you really did talk to her.
  set knows_passcode true
luna:frown [if TOLD != 'silent' && !knows_passcode]
  en: No... that's not it. But thank you for coming.

set bond = miki_trust + luna_affection
narration [if bond >= 25]
  en: For a moment the café is very quiet, as if someone just let out a long breath.

branch
  if knows_passcode == true && luna_affection >= 15 -> ending_secret
  if miki_trust >= 20 -> ending_true
  if miki_trust >= 10 -> ending_good
  -> ending_bad

luna:frown label=proof_retry
  en: That doesn't prove you heard from Miki. Do you have something she sent you?
-> #ask_proof
